{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of the shaded region <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/78680a85026b1a8a1a3c043f423e5894c6b6ecdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEDC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> in parallelogram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c13a8cbe85a4698752f8bf51231ea66b9040006.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(10); pair A,B,C,D,E; A=origin; B=(4,8); C=(14,8); D=(10,0); E=(4,0); fill(B--E--D--C--cycle,gray); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(B--E); label(&quot;A&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;B&quot;,B,NW); label(&quot;C&quot;,C,NE); label(&quot;D&quot;,D,SE); label(&quot;E&quot;,E,S); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(9,8),N); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(7,0),S); label(&quot;$8$&quot;,(4,4),W); draw((3,0)--(3,1)--(4,1)); [/asy]\" width=\"278\" height=\"178\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/8/f889092bdbb6b6b68e67c6e6bddd1856593c67e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 48 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 60 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 64 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/78680a85026b1a8a1a3c043f423e5894c6b6ecdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEDC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> can be found by subtracting the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1b3b8188354494cb248bd9965a24d0b9f1ef814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> from that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a parallelogram, so its area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1e92fab09d461ccb4cb8d23378489e7d1dc751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\cdot8=80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/1/951618b3f9237d0c7b3af1add029acf540c8d238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = BC = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1b3b8188354494cb248bd9965a24d0b9f1ef814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/262b8f004ea99a6c610c71f7cd9747e7d3b2590c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4 \\cdot 8 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/78680a85026b1a8a1a3c043f423e5894c6b6ecdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEDC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17e0fbc985869d87160b22b8e91ec055d8f765c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80 - 16 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"149\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/78680a85026b1a8a1a3c043f423e5894c6b6ecdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEDC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is a trapezoid. Therefore, its area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/f/6df90777ddce2f57d16f625551afc8a6a9dfca66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}(8)(6+10)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"191\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME\" title=\"1989 AJHSME\">1989 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=19